    - target: {fileID: 6562584109814120277, guid: c479db5a6e4068643ac76a90e5b27a60, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: "Found another person in here. Problem is he was walking around with
        this big lantern. I kept telling him \"You idiot! Turn off that lantern!
        You'll kill us all!\". He didn't get it. Said the lantern kept him safe.
        I had to leave him behind. \r\n\r\nYesterday, I found a young man who had
        been grafted onto a wooden doll. It was carrying that very same lantern.
        Poor sod \u2013 but I told him what would happen. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
